     "description": "Will be estimated using the Kaplan-Meier method. A stratified log-rank test will be used to assess whether OS differs with respect to the addition of trastuzumab to a chemotherapy regimen including AC and paclitaxel. Ninety-five percent confidence intervals will be reported for relative risks, for OS at the 5-year point, and for absolute benefit as defined by differences in DFS and OS.",
